{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53289","headline":"诗偈 一一四 · 庞藴","name":"诗偈 一一四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"惭愧一躯身，梵号波罗柰。\n被贼一羣使，寻常不自在。\n亦名爲枯井，亦名爲韛袋。\n亦名朽故宅，亦名幻三昧。\n佛駡作死屍，乘屍渡大海。\n大海元无水，死屍非是船。\n熟看世上事，总是假因缘。\n若了身心相，空里任横眠。\n具此六惭愧，实是不求天。\n（以上一百十四首均见咸丰元年刊于頔编《庞居士语录》卷中）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"庞藴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53289.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53289","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}